    "description": {
      "value": "This toxin erratically stimulates the limbs, forcing unexpected shifts in momentum. The result resembles a gangly, lurching dance. At the start of each turn, the victim takes one or more Steps in a random direction if able. This movement is forced and doesn't count against the victim's actions for the round.\n\nDC: 30\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 6 rounds\n- Stage 1: 4d6 poison damage and 1 Step of forced movement (1 round)\n- Stage 2: 6d6 poison damage, clumsy 1, and 1 Step of forced movement (1 round)\n- Stage 3: 8d6 poison damage, clumsy 2, 2 Steps of forced movement (1 round)\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact"
